From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Youll <andrewyoull86@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 09:05:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] RISC OS platform: UL_RISCOS, a Joystick SWI back end for js,
 silent sl

ul.h: UL_RISCOS (GCCSDK defines __riscos__, not __unix__), unistd/fcntl,
and a ulDynamicLibrary that always fails (UnixLib has no dlopen).
ssg.cxx: the current-context check uses EGL (riscos-mesa) instead of GLX.
js/jsRISCOS.cxx: USBJoystick's slot API, else Joystick_Read stick 0.
sl: a slDSP that never works (no sound device), so sl/sm build and play
nothing; RISC OS programs use OpenAL for sound.
---
 src/js/jsRISCOS.cxx    | 314 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/sl/sl.h            |   2 +
 src/sl/slDSP.cxx       |  32 +++++
 src/sl/slPortability.h |   4 +
 src/ssg/ssg.cxx        |   4 +
 src/util/ul.h          |  26 ++++
 6 files changed, 382 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/js/jsRISCOS.cxx

diff --git a/src/js/jsRISCOS.cxx b/src/js/jsRISCOS.cxx
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..79ddd00
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/js/jsRISCOS.cxx
@@ -0,0 +1,314 @@
+/*
+     PLIB - A Suite of Portable Game Libraries
+     Copyright (C) 1998,2002  Steve Baker
+
